: ["Open seat: Tim Walz (D) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Minnesota's open governor's race features Senator Amy Klobuchar facing state Representative Lisa Demuth, with Walz retiring from the ballot. Klobuchar, a three-term senator with strong statewide name recognition, has raised roughly $7 million to Demuth's $360,000, giving her a dominant advertising position. Every recent poll shows her ahead, with leads ranging from seven to eighteen points and an average near eleven.\n\nExpert raters overwhelmingly place the race in the Safe or Solid Democratic column, and prediction markets price Klobuchar's chances around 97%. The state's Democratic lean and a favorable national environment for the party add to her structural advantages. Demuth's path would require a major late break against the polling trend, which no current evidence suggests is underway.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9683, "margin": 10.03}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9647, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.931, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9476, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9456, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9491, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9656, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9546, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9536, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9443, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9456, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9461, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9453, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9445, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9598, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.927, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.949, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9409, "margin": 9.